<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cairn Energy Plc to list in Australia.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cairn Energy Plc to list in Australia.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K.-based energy group Cairn Energy Plc said on Wednesday it had brought forward plans to list on the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>Cairn is currently in a merger process with Command Petroleum Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Cairn is offering a choice of a A$1.10 a share cash offer or a scrip offer of two Cairn shares for every 13 Command shares.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to list as an exempt foreign entity, the listing being subject to Cairn's takeover offer becoming unconditional.</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
